B.aRz=new A.fi("Conveyor-belt Sushi","Tokyo","Nigiri & spicy noodles","Colourful plates of nigiri beside a steaming bowl.\nOur Tokyo table, exactly as we remember it.","Tuna, salmon, ginger, and a hot bowl of spicy noodles gathered around the conveyor-belt counter.","EA-JP-001")
B.aRm=new A.fi("Soba Counter","Tokyo","Tempura soba set","Crisp tempura, cool soba, and a giant kakiage.\nA whole lunch arranged on one tray.","A generous soba set with dipping sauce, shredded vegetables, tempura, and a golden vegetable fritter.","EA-JP-002")
B.aRo=new A.fi("Street Snack Stand","Tokyo","Spiral potato","A paper cup, a long skewer, and a tower of crisp potato.\nThe perfect walking snack.","Thin potato spirals fried until golden and dusted with seasoning, photographed just before the first bite.","EA-JP-003")
B.aRA=new A.fi("Kyoto Street Stall","Kyoto","Taiyaki","Still warm and wrapped in paper.\nA fish-shaped sweet carried through Kyoto.","A freshly baked taiyaki, held in one hand while the street blurred softly behind it.","EA-JP-004")
B.aRx=new A.fi("Matcha Stop","Kyoto","Matcha soft serve","Deep green soft serve with a crisp cone.\nA cool pause between Kyoto streets.","A tall swirl of matcha ice cream photographed against the warm wood of the shopfront.","EA-JP-005")
B.aRu=new A.fi("Matcha Republic","Uji","Layered matcha drink","Cream, milk, and matcha stacked in soft layers.\nAlmost too pretty to stir.","A chilled matcha drink from Uji, with a vivid green base fading upward through milk and cream.","EA-JP-006")
B.aRt=new A.fi("Kyoto Patisserie","Kyoto","Strawberry shortcake","Soft sponge, fresh cream, and bright strawberries.\nA small, immaculate slice.","The classic strawberry cake arrived as a neat wedge, topped with cream and one glossy berry.","EA-JP-007")
B.aRB=new A.fi("Kyoto Patisserie","Kyoto","Blueberry tart","A tiny tart crowded with blueberries.\nGlossy fruit over a crisp pastry shell.","A berry-covered tart with custard beneath, photographed on the caf\xe9 table before we shared it.","EA-JP-008")
B.aRy=new A.fi("Pancake Caf\xe9","Kyoto","Strawberry souffl\xe9 pancakes","Pillowy pancakes under strawberries and cream.\nDessert with impossible height.","Two airy pancakes topped with fresh strawberries, whipped cream, sauce, and a dusting of sugar.","EA-JP-009")
B.aRv=new A.fi("Dinner Table","Kyoto","Kimchi pancake","Crisp edges and a soft, savoury centre.\nOne evening, one shared plate.","A hot kimchi pancake cut into wedges and photographed at the table before everyone reached in.","EA-JP-010")
B.aRw=new A.fi("Hanami Snack Stall","Kyoto","Hanami dango","Pink, white, and green on one skewer.\nA springtime sweet made for wandering.","Three soft rice dumplings in the colours of blossom season, held up against the Kyoto street.","EA-JP-011")
B.aRr=new A.fi("Udon Counter","Osaka","Udon","Thick noodles, a bright egg yolk, and scallions.\nSimple, glossy, satisfying.","A bowl of springy udon dressed with egg, greens, sesame, and crisp tempura crumbs.","EA-JP-012")
B.aRp=new A.fi("Osaka Sweet Shop","Osaka","Strawberry daifuku","A whole strawberry tucked into soft mochi.\nSweet, chewy, and gone too quickly.","The daifuku was split open to reveal bright fruit, red bean filling, and a delicate mochi shell.","EA-JP-013")
B.aRq=new A.fi("Nara Caf\xe9","Nara","Berry soda & macarons","A sparkling berry drink with two tiny companions.\nThe most playful caf\xe9 table of the trip.","A ruby soda crowned with berries, served beside two character-shaped macarons on a wooden tray.","EA-JP-014")
B.aRn=new A.fi("Curry House","Nara","Vegetable curry","Rice, roasted vegetables, and two curries.\nA colourful plate after a long walk.","A generous curry plate with grains, greens, roasted vegetables, pickles, and contrasting sauces.","EA-JP-015")
B.aRs=new A.fi("Nara Bakery","Nara","Strawberry cream buns","Golden buns filled with cream and berries.\nA bakery-window choice with no regrets.","Two soft pastries filled with whipped cream and fresh strawberries, dusted lightly with sugar.","EA-JP-016")
